---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Casey Manos API documentation">
	<h1>Casey Manos API documentation</h1>
	<p>
		The Casey Manos website provides a small public, read-only API for retrieving the same profile
		information available on the homepage. GET /api/profile returns JSON with name, description,
		url, email, and sameAs profile links. No authentication or API key is required. The API has no
		write operations and does not provide access to private records. GET and HEAD are supported.
		Unsupported methods return HTTP 405, and unknown API routes return HTTP 404, with structured
		JSON including an error code, message, and resolution hint. The machine-readable OpenAPI schema
		is at /openapi.json. For full page content, send Accept: text/markdown to a page URL. Responses
		include Vary: Accept, so clients should respect representation-aware caching. Use /sitemap.xml
		to discover pages and /llms.txt for guidance. There is no MCP server, SDK, or CLI for this site.
	</p>
	<p>
		<a href="/">Home</a> · <a href="/resume/">Resume</a> · <a href="/contact/">Contact</a> ·{' '}
		<a href="/openapi.json">OpenAPI</a>
	</p>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
	h1 {
		font-size: 2rem;
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
	}
	p {
		line-height: 1.7;
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
	}
</style>
